    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_1",
      "hash64": "60396BBCAB779DC0",
      "text": "橘子學院的玄關。\\n可在櫃台報到上課。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_18",
      "hash64": "F93009975C416C68",
      "text": "葡萄學院的玄關。\\n可在櫃台報到上課。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_2",
      "hash64": "60396EBCAB77A2D9",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]的房間。\\n位在學校內的另一個自己的房間。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_3",
      "hash64": "60396DBCAB77A126",
      "text": "妮莫的房間。\\n整理得井然有序。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_4",
      "hash64": "603970BCAB77A63F",
      "text": "派帕的房間。\\n聞得到料理的香氣。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_5",
      "hash64": "60396FBCAB77A48C",
      "text": "牡丹的房間。\\n裡面滿是機器，光線略顯昏暗。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_6",
      "hash64": "603972BCAB77A9A5",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]和妮莫的教室。\\n屬於綜合課程。班導師是吉尼亞老師。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_7",
      "hash64": "603971BCAB77A7F2",
      "text": "高一個年級的２年級學生教室。\\n屬於文組課程。班導師是賽吉老師。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_19",
      "hash64": "F9300A975C416E1B",
      "text": "派帕的教室。\\n屬於文組課程。班導師是賽吉老師。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_8",
      "hash64": "603974BCAB77AD0B",
      "text": "別的班級的教室。\\n屬於理組課程。班導師是泰姆老師。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_20",
      "hash64": "F93A13975C49D1EB",
      "text": "牡丹的教室。\\n屬於理組課程。班導師是泰姆老師。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_9",
      "hash64": "603973BCAB77AB58",
      "text": "校長的房間。\\n裡面有克拉韋爾校長的書桌和研究器材。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_10",
      "hash64": "F93001975C415ED0",
      "text": "老師們的房間。\\n在這裡能遇到許多不同的老師。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_11",
      "hash64": "F93002975C416083",
      "text": "身體不舒服的學生會來這裡休息。\\n據說也有很多學生是衝著米莫莎老師而來。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_12",
      "hash64": "F93003975C416236",
      "text": "從日常用品到道具應有盡有。\\n這裡的麵包很神奇地總是剛烤出爐。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_13",
      "hash64": "F93004975C4163E9",
      "text": "用來上家政課的教室。\\n裡面排放著亮晶晶的餐具和料理用具。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_14",
      "hash64": "F93005975C41659C",
      "text": "用來上生物課的教室。\\n裡面有許多顯微鏡之類的實驗器材。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_15",
      "hash64": "F93006975C41674F",
      "text": "用來上美術課的教室。\\n裡面展示著學生們的作品。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_16",
      "hash64": "F93007975C416902",
      "text": "食堂的阿姨親手做的料理\\n天天都美味，而且營養滿分。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_17",
      "hash64": "F93008975C416AB5",
      "text": "用來上對戰學的中庭。\\n是可運動或小歇的休憩場所。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "schoolmap_3_0",
      "hash64": "6788A3BCAF39BEE8",
      "text": "返回",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
