      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "schoolmap_5_0",
      "hash64": "565E55BCA58C311E",
      "text": "藍莓學園的玄關。\\n中央有對戰場。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "schoolmap_5_1",
      "hash64": "565E56BCA58C32D1",
      "text": "可一邊在４個區域冒險，\\n一邊學習寶可夢相關知識的海中庭園。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "schoolmap_5_2",
      "hash64": "565E53BCA58C2DB8",
      "text": "烏栗的教室。\\n會在開班會時使用。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "schoolmap_5_3",
      "hash64": "565E54BCA58C2F6B",
      "text": "丹瑜的教室。\\n班導師是白蕾雅老師。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "schoolmap_5_4",
      "hash64": "565E59BCA58C37EA",
      "text": "從日用品到道具應有盡有。\\n需注意的是，這裡只能使用ＢＰ付款。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "schoolmap_5_5",
      "hash64": "565E5ABCA58C399D",
      "text": "食堂的阿姨親手做的料理\\n分量十足，保證吃得飽。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
